WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.400
Space doesn't belong to one nation.

2
00:00:03.733 --> 00:00:05.367
It belongs to all of us.

3
00:00:05.867 --> 00:00:09.600
Yet today, space exploration remains divided.

4
00:00:10.133 --> 00:00:14.433
Enter SpaceDAO: one open network to share technology,

5
00:00:14.567 --> 00:00:16.267
resources, and knowledge.

6
00:00:16.733 --> 00:00:17.933
Decide together.

7
00:00:18.233 --> 00:00:19.267
Launch together.

8
00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:22.133
Design your mission with live NASA data.

9
00:00:22.533 --> 00:00:23.567
Play SpaceDAO.

10
00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:26.233
Space belongs to humanity.
